---
# TimerTwo's code of 2023, until version 2.0.0 rewrites it in the namespace timer_two (OIL 3):
# its names, macros, typedefs and unsuffixed C enums are what these groups report, some 450
# places in src/ alone. They come on with 2.0.0, each with what it finds fixed, and this file
# goes then. The tests and the mock are new and keep every check.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-assignment-in-if-condition,
  -bugprone-macro-parentheses,
  -bugprone-signed-bitwise,
  -clang-diagnostic-unreachable-code-break,
  -cppcoreguidelines-*,
  -google-*,
  -misc-*,
  -modernize-*,
  -performance-enum-size,
  -readability-*
